BT 1 0 0 1 0 36 Tm 1.154625 Tw /F3+0 10.5 Tf 15.5 TL (Bowties do not form for one reason. Many begin as responsible responses to real conditions. Information is) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.8903 Tw (scarce, time is short, capability is uneven, authority cannot be distributed, or the organization needs one) Tj T* 0 Tw (visible person to decide.) Tj T* ET
