BT 1 0 0 1 0 20.5 Tm 3.4576 Tw /F3+0 10.5 Tf 15.5 TL (The failure is allowing more judgment to collect in one head than operating conditions require. The) Tj T* 0 Tw (organization then preserves that arrangement after the conditions change.) Tj T* ET
