.113725 .141176 .129412 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 36 Tm -0.013179 Tw /F3+0 10.5 Tf 15.5 TL (Historically, information was slow to collect, difficult to move, and unevenly distributed. Sometimes security or) Tj T* 0 Tw .636808 Tw (confidentiality prevented it from being widely shared. Putting the available information into one experienced) Tj T* 0 Tw (head was often the fastest way to reach a decision.) Tj T* ET
