BT 1 0 0 1 0 20.5 Tm 2.155071 Tw /F3+0 10.5 Tf 15.5 TL (Sometimes time is the governing constraint. The organization needs a responsible decision before it can) Tj T* 0 Tw (distribute all the information, reconcile every judgment, or determine the best possible answer.) Tj T* ET
