q
.113725 .141176 .129412 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 20.5 Tm 1.152656 Tw /F3+0 10.5 Tf 15.5 TL (The best decision is not always available. The organization needs the best decision it can responsibly make) Tj T* 0 Tw (within the time allowed. Concentrating authority in one person allows it to act.) Tj T* ET
